.TH proc_kpageflags 5 2026\-02\-08 "Linux man\-pages (未リリース)" 
.SH 名前
/proc/kpageflags \- physical pages frame masks
.SH 説明
.TP 
\fI/proc/kpageflags\fP (Linux 2.6.25 以降)
This file contains 64\-bit masks corresponding to each physical page frame;
it is indexed by page frame number (see the discussion of
\fI/proc/\fPpid\fI/pagemap\fP).  The bits are as follows:
.RS
.IP
.TS
r l l l.
0	\-	KPF_LOCKED
1	\-	KPF_ERROR
2	\-	KPF_REFERENCED
3	\-	KPF_UPTODATE
4	\-	KPF_DIRTY
5	\-	KPF_LRU
6	\-	KPF_ACTIVE
7	\-	KPF_SLAB
8	\-	KPF_WRITEBACK
9	\-	KPF_RECLAIM
10	\-	KPF_BUDDY
11	\-	KPF_MMAP	(Linux 2.6.31 以降)
12	\-	KPF_ANON	(Linux 2.6.31 以降)
13	\-	KPF_SWAPCACHE	(Linux 2.6.31 以降)
14	\-	KPF_SWAPBACKED	(Linux 2.6.31 以降)
15	\-	KPF_COMPOUND_HEAD	(Linux 2.6.31 以降)
16	\-	KPF_COMPOUND_TAIL	(Linux 2.6.31 以降)
17	\-	KPF_HUGE	(Linux 2.6.31 以降)
18	\-	KPF_UNEVICTABLE	(Linux 2.6.31 以降)
19	\-	KPF_HWPOISON	(Linux 2.6.31 以降)
20	\-	KPF_NOPAGE	(Linux 2.6.31 以降)
21	\-	KPF_KSM	(Linux 2.6.32 以降)
22	\-	KPF_THP	(Linux 3.4 以降)
23	\-	KPF_BALLOON	(Linux 3.18 以降)
.\" KPF_BALLOON: commit 09316c09dde33aae14f34489d9e3d243ec0d5938
24	\-	KPF_ZERO_PAGE	(Linux 4.0 以降)
.\" KPF_ZERO_PAGE: commit 56873f43abdcd574b25105867a990f067747b2f4
25	\-	KPF_IDLE	(Linux 4.3 以降)
.\" KPF_IDLE: commit f074a8f49eb87cde95ac9d040ad5e7ea4f029738
26	\-	KPF_PGTABLE	(Linux 4.18 以降)
.\" KPF_PGTABLE: commit 1d40a5ea01d53251c23c7be541d3f4a656cfc537
.TE
.RE
.IP
.\" commit ad3bdefe877afb47480418fdb05ecd42842de65e
.\" commit e07a4b9217d1e97d2f3a62b6b070efdc61212110
For further details on the meanings of these bits, see the kernel source
file \fIDocumentation/admin\-guide/mm/pagemap.rst\fP.  Before Linux 2.6.29,
\fBKPF_WRITEBACK\fP, \fBKPF_RECLAIM\fP, \fBKPF_BUDDY\fP, and \fBKPF_LOCKED\fP did not
report correctly.
.IP
The \fI/proc/kpageflags\fP file is present only if the
\fBCONFIG_PROC_PAGE_MONITOR\fP kernel configuration option is enabled.
